//RS /// the JIT all keep the same meaning without an engine-specific rule.
//RS /// `order` lists the *lowered* argument slots in the order the caller wrote
//RS /// them, taken from each source argument's `flags.source_index`. Slots the
//RS /// caller did not write (a filled default) are absent — a default runs after
