//RS             .get_mut(slot)
//RS             .expect("binder source-order slot must have a lowered argument");
//RS         // The name has to be unique across nesting: a nested reordered call is
//RS         // lowered as the initialiser of one of these very temporaries, and the
//RS         // interpreter shares one scope with it. `site` is the call's source
